    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Classic surf re-imagined in the Godot game engine. Free to play and made for everyone.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/9ea4a537edb9718dd39abd6ef156cdb2.poster.avif?t=1752528957\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/9ea4a537edb9718dd39abd6ef156cdb2.webm?t=1752528957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/9ea4a537edb9718dd39abd6ef156cdb2.mp4?t=1752528957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SurfsUp is a faithful recreation of the community air-surfing that is designed for both veterans and newcomers. Whether you're chasing world records or riding your first ramp, SurfsUp offers precise movement, a competitive feel, and an easy entry point into one of gaming's most iconic experiences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Multiplayer, Your Way</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surf solo or with friends. Join public lobbies or host your own with full control over map selection. <i>Private lobbies are included with the optional Supporter Bundle.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Surfing Mechanics</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your technique in high-speed air-surfing. Ride ramps, carve tight turns, and launch massive jumps with precision and flow. It's all about momentum, timing, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Daily Map Rotation</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new random set of maps every day keeps sessions fresh and helps you master a wide range of techniques.\u00a0<i>All maps are included with the optional Supporter Bundle.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Classic Surf Maps</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on iconic maps like Utopia, Boreas, Summit, and Mesa, <strong>no unlocks or paywalls.</strong> These community classics are <strong>always available</strong>, letting you sharpen your skills on the maps that helped define the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Built in Voice Chat</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach, trash-talk, or just socialize. Voice is fully integrated into every lobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Global and Friends Only Leaderboards</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete worldwide or with your crew. Every run counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Cosmetic Item Drops</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tradable player models and surf animations just by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Supporter Bundle DLC</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An optional upgrade that unlocks all maps, custom lobbies, unique cosmetics, and supports the future of the game's development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/75f9aa60e1492f04cf62bfe7f660b7f3.poster.avif?t=1752528957\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/75f9aa60e1492f04cf62bfe7f660b7f3.webm?t=1752528957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/75f9aa60e1492f04cf62bfe7f660b7f3.mp4?t=1752528957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Classic surf re-imagined in the Godot game engine. Free to play and made for everyone.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/9ea4a537edb9718dd39abd6ef156cdb2.poster.avif?t=1752528957\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/9ea4a537edb9718dd39abd6ef156cdb2.webm?t=1752528957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/9ea4a537edb9718dd39abd6ef156cdb2.mp4?t=1752528957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SurfsUp is a faithful recreation of the community air-surfing that is designed for both veterans and newcomers. Whether you're chasing world records or riding your first ramp, SurfsUp offers precise movement, a competitive feel, and an easy entry point into one of gaming's most iconic experiences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Multiplayer, Your Way</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surf solo or with friends. Join public lobbies or host your own with full control over map selection. <i>Private lobbies are included with the optional Supporter Bundle.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Surfing Mechanics</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your technique in high-speed air-surfing. Ride ramps, carve tight turns, and launch massive jumps with precision and flow. It's all about momentum, timing, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Daily Map Rotation</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new random set of maps every day keeps sessions fresh and helps you master a wide range of techniques.\u00a0<i>All maps are included with the optional Supporter Bundle.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Classic Surf Maps</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on iconic maps like Utopia, Boreas, Summit, and Mesa, <strong>no unlocks or paywalls.</strong> These community classics are <strong>always available</strong>, letting you sharpen your skills on the maps that helped define the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Built in Voice Chat</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach, trash-talk, or just socialize. Voice is fully integrated into every lobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Global and Friends Only Leaderboards</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete worldwide or with your crew. Every run counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Cosmetic Item Drops</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tradable player models and surf animations just by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Supporter Bundle DLC</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An optional upgrade that unlocks all maps, custom lobbies, unique cosmetics, and supports the future of the game's development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/75f9aa60e1492f04cf62bfe7f660b7f3.poster.avif?t=1752528957\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/75f9aa60e1492f04cf62bfe7f660b7f3.webm?t=1752528957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454830/extras/75f9aa60e1492f04cf62bfe7f660b7f3.mp4?t=1752528957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
